			"notes": "For Minecraft 1.20.6 with fabric loader 1.15.10 or newer.\nNeeds [fabric-api 0.99.4](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api/version/0.99.4+1.20.6) and [fabric language kotlin 1.11.0](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-language-kotlin/version/1.11.0+kotlin.2.0.0) installed. Newer versions may be fine.\nCan optionally use [Athena 3.4.0](https://modrinth.com/mod/athena-ctm/version/HXNN4xsh) for connected textures.\n\nFix the glass block causing shadows.\nFix the glass block requiring the camera on the same side as the player unlike normal glass.\nAdd support for Athena.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/UTAS-Programming-Club/HardenedGlass/compare/0.1.1...0.2.0"
